  Expected:
    status: unimplemented_engine_shape
    reason: RL compositional-placement shape outside the rule-numbered RL verifier inventory (the RL dischargers serve numbered RL-1..RL-34 suffixes only). The authoritative machine-check is the compiled Lean AimsProof.Ledger (lake build clean): compositional_placement_sound discharges the three-clause placement invariant (per-class per-path net zero, read floor, dynamic-COW sibling floor) into balanced-and-safe on every CFG walk, with the K1 unwind-merge, K2 TRMC back-edge, and K3 TRMC hole-fill release-after-fill kill-criterion instantiations and the pre-read-release / past-merge-relocation / early-sibling-release / post-tail-call-dec rejections, over events derived from the committed RL-2 twelve-kind table and the T1 partition representatives.
